<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of memorable characters: from the kind Mr. Baesie to the ominous owl Velenia and the menacing Mr. Kyn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate through puzzle solving, sneaking around deathly enemies, and overcoming platforming challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a rabbit and use your forms to escape the threats of Bunny Hall and Corolla.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Chris Darril. Published and licensed by Maximum Entertainment France SAS. Developed by Little Sewing Machine, in collaboration with Meangrip Game Studios and Dreams Uncorporated. All rights reserved.</p>","developers":["Little Sewing Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428980/0ef8fa7d496ea1cc67bab8f32e9f2d1d3e9eac8c/header.jpg?t=1771864372","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Little Sewing Machine. Created by Chris Darril. Published and licensed by Maximum Entertainment France SAS. Developed by Little Sewing Machine, in collaboration with Meangrip Game Studios and Dreams Uncorporated. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2428980/642913721/c9a73d547626a61fcc8f6c6668e7361f1d01c7be/1761665505/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761834040","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2428980/642913721/c9a73d547626a61fcc8f6c6668e7361f1d01c7be/1761665505/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761834040","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s